<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian security forces arrested the suspect known as the &amp;quot;Butcher of Baniyas&amp;quot; for the 2013 coastal massacres and foiled a Daesh plot targeting a police patrol. Two Syrian oil pipelines were damaged in attacks on energy infrastructure, and Israeli forces struck Lebanon and detained four individuals in Syria. Lebanese and Syrian workers were permitted to enter a northern security zone to harvest olives, while road accidents across Syria caused two deaths and 29 injuries in 24 hours. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQdnVjS2Z5NTMwMndLT1d3SXpnNmt2a2xnU21lWE8wQ0lQTTkyUUtKSXdZTkVDNlZFWHREaERBWFF0bkR4Ui0zM3FMc3VGZVB3aHI1LU5UTG5NZXIybjZfQ2xJcDZSMDRYbnBZRmJKRWJXcm5TR1k0SkplZlNXTkljZlpQclJHNjRuSm94S2ZUQVlQSnUwQzEzT0JZWjFrNVA2VGl0VA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNYjVUQTEyR3E2NVZVZGpUenVOQm5PQjFTSnFDQ2ZqRzdtS05ub3EtMzkxX1FjdTZhbmNaVlRtT09wRXI1elJXN2pILU85VWlMRFoza2FHY3FHdnU1NWdlS3ZkYzZ0UnJSYnFrdEYyM1d1a0FmMlVqLTZvX2Z5Yzhxc0txVFJaRklUN1A2TVYzSjdVSjNjMnNVal9abUxZb25EN2NidklCWUxJN0FvMU1RUFJ1UTlGTHEzRk1lUE1n?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Media Line&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5uWmJCN3d0TlN2MTJlcmZ6VEUzLW1ubzBWakx6ZnVMYVctekdNZFNjeGctWHBpbmVsWEVyQngyZnM3UW5QNTQwcQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQdXZ4aVI2SzhyWDdwR0Z3SmY0US1uUmFVU0JDMmRKaTBnUWplWktYcm0tdEVrUm8wTXV3QzUzYkFKWVVnLVBFVGVWRXNMTzY4dVRnQXRuNW1ZT0kzZUFqTFhONy1VUHd5dUc2Wmd0STdLeXhfOHhCdE9OQ1Bnb2VPLWdCZy1nRWNqbk0wU1lSREV4VkhDNlhVeFp6anBuV1dpSUUyUDkxNTJicGI0?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt